{"time": 1753426211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765599394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不是不行吧）"}
{"time": 1753426328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350229168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（先继续炎火村吧，那个过几天再开）"}
{"time": 1753426420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066309839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=604383418]似乎也没必要再起飞，大病初愈颇有种对一切的好奇心，仔细观看沿途的风景，\"嗯，想到马上就要去火山了，这种山清水秀的地方还是忍不住多待一会呢\""}
{"time": 1753426508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295050096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（并非大病）"}
