{"time": 1753427629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101713153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...好像有点难，暴风雨倒是简单一些?\""}
{"time": 1753427636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276673294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如果....就可以)"}
{"time": 1753427650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780189459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是好像还不会)"}
{"time": 1753427658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613997189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1787805507]“我弄不出雾来啦”夏弥吐吐舌头“不过可以试试把云拉下来。在那之前……跟着？”"}
{"time": 1753427719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608750523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，她们似乎也是去神社那边，我们悄悄跟着。\"心里盘算着，小声开口"}
{"time": 1753427938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459695179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1917131839]走过被泥巴淹过三分之一的青石板路，又走上一截立着鸟居的神道，一面开着门的院墙便在坡顶出现"}
{"time": 1753428149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169926361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "白墙灰瓦，最外面的这道门看着倒是和一般的院子没有太大区别"}
{"time": 1753428193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237401159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“进去看看？”"}
