{"time": 1753429808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125143947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "顺带一提，天色已经转暗，霞光逐渐取代湛蓝的天光"}
