{"time": 1753430607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636970424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”沧澜抬起头“明明只是生物，为什么要用这种名字来称呼呢”"}
{"time": 1753430624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176257688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好深奥的问题，我也不懂”"}
