{"time": 1753435080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816863205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在换乘）"}
{"time": 1753435626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004944258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有啦，我的意思是……”夏弥带着你们缓缓升空，随后加速“说不定过不了几年，我在你们面前就不够看了呐”"}
{"time": 1753435894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2147024504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"紧紧抱着她的手臂，\"夏弥担心这个干什么?不管怎么成长，安一直是安，始终如一啦。\""}
{"time": 1753436104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23128484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥是不是不见了）"}
