{"time": 1753633063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092345858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "轰鸣响起，很难说冲击、爆破和龙气喷发的声音究竟哪个比较大，岩壁也因此震颤，落下些许炽热的碎石"}
{"time": 1753633102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186488681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（-20了，虽然这位大人血条应该有个50左右）"}
{"time": 1753633124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409799289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过碎龙还没半血，她倒是先快半血了）"}
{"time": 1753633174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060332885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"赫萝！没事吧？\"眼见赫萝被轰飞，立刻大声询问那边的情况"}
{"time": 1753633214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130957793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "烟尘弥漫，碎龙直起身来，岩壁里面暂时没有动静，而碎龙正在舔舐自己的双拳，重新激活黏菌"}
{"time": 1753633244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303391190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=300125097]你身上的黏菌脱落，随风飘走，随后猛然爆炸"}
{"time": 1753633269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204719201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼.. 真惊险啊”"}
{"time": 1753633282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904733673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然很兴奋，但是也不能轻敌啊。\"喃喃，\"我们小心一点，夏弥。\""}
{"time": 1753633338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912376506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只能说寻常古龙里保二争一的肉体强度，区区爆炸还是随便吃的……吗？）"}
