{"time": 1753634210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116573482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沧澜双手勉强持握着大剑滚回露儿身边，手撑着地面站起来，身上的盔甲有多处破损，有些灰头土脸但神采奕奕“厉害……”"}
{"time": 1753634342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19270307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"听说手甲上的黏菌还能再生，保持好攻击节奏吧。\""}
{"time": 1753634356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480542002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼...好厉害的龙，沧澜你没事吧”"}
