{"time": 1753683120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437384685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来头角也错了）"}
{"time": 1753683123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414733795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧啧，看来作为发泄对象已经完成使命了。\"招呼赫萝下来，\"受伤了吗？\""}
{"time": 1753683379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529524516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1414733795]赫萝左手搭在右肩上，右臂做着回环，皱眉做着深呼吸“小伤，咳…别管，这才哪到哪”"}
{"time": 1753683487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854819969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1529524516]\"好啦，就别逞强了。\"在包里翻出回复药，思虑了一下换成了一颗黄色的秘药递给她，\"喏，疗伤药。\""}
{"time": 1753683505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478041531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来我以前这么富，随身带着8颗秘药，现在还剩一半)"}
{"time": 1753683547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197116907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=192725471]“还是来看看吧”沧澜扭头招呼你“你不是要装备吗”"}
{"time": 1753683830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110721349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼，这可是龙型都有用的药哦?\"打个响指，\"碎龙的装备防御性能不错，露儿来取素材吧。\""}
{"time": 1753683972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051437263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那好吧，谢谢”扒素材"}
{"time": 1753684038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481459798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854819969]她盯了你一会，不过身上的银色盔甲的几处焦黑和龟裂想藏也藏不住，索性接过去，随手丢进嘴里“……还不错，这玩意还有多吗？”"}
{"time": 1753684140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174916142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还剩几颗吧。\"打量这她身上的伤势，\"感觉怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1753684392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797953598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2051437263]（where）"}
{"time": 1753684499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117611244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "角吧"}
{"time": 1753684565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126762114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1174916142]“说了是小伤……这家伙有点东西但不多，我还没动真格的呢”她摇头，身上甲胄的裂纹缓慢愈合"}
{"time": 1753684737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219644887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117611244][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 碎龙的角并不尖利，倒是很有质感，比起角质更像是矿物，极其坚硬。摘下黏菌之后泛着乌光"}
{"time": 1753684752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465937235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126762114]\"嗨！赫萝当然不用动真格啦。\"顺着话说，\"有伤就得治嘛...嗯，怎么样?这次畅快了吗？\""}
{"time": 1753686092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146867645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=465937235]“嗯，这次打爽了”赫萝叉腰，挨个疏通气道，像锅炉房的连排烟囱"}
{"time": 1753695733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179385400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉八蛛矛)"}
{"time": 1753696053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121842356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥呢）"}
{"time": 1753696143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646105854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1146867645]“不管看多少次，这个构造...”绕到她身后打量，“都觉得很酷啊...”"}
{"time": 1753697832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205451105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=646105854]“我也觉得”她将一侧翅膀贴到手臂上，如臂刃般延伸“这就说明我是最快最强~”"}
{"time": 1753697907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593874390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"摸摸看啦。\"手停在空中，带着期待看着她"}
{"time": 1753697978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123348041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，那你小心烫”赫萝在炫耀这方面一向是有求必应"}
{"time": 1753698143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351694175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=219644887]“看着倒真是好材料……海里的生物很少能长出密度这么高的甲壳”沧澜也折下一块甲壳“不过对我来说有点笨重，不然我也想弄个装备看看”（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1753698443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112456805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=123348041]\"哼哼...\"轻手轻脚，先戳一下另一侧的翼尖，然后顺着结构一直往翼尾摸索"}
{"time": 1753698727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509313554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "显然这种地方也不会有多少神经，接近角质，所以赫萝也没什么反应。而前不久才火力全开过，此时确实有些烫手。坚硬光滑，转折处却又极尽锐利"}
{"time": 1753698775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429540339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=54486D8449420FB616501634C44AD0A2.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT62chf7nDNSzlOx7jIkH8HVmK-SRju_ooBIP8KKOyfg4St344DMgRwcm9kUIC9owFaEO2cHP0g2DbfPrSbCV2pNjh6AoKV&amp;rkey=CAMSMB881klqXuL0CYmzj_WMhdAAZhmxc0EE4g8GcAa519R3tttlTZ1zCZ1aDa9rMtdnbw,file_size=2277230]"}
