{"time": 1753709064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146893295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（洗个澡）"}
{"time": 1753709126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350146247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼.. 舒服多了”擦擦汗“谢谢安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1753709183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046909595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯哼？果然是有用的吧。”松了口气，“走吧，不过真正的雪山之主来这里的话，火山想必不会存在了吧。”掩面不知道想到了什么，轻笑"}
{"time": 1753709247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609367116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd6"}
{"time": 1753709247, "type": "reply", "message_id": "609367116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D6=2"}
{"time": 1753709343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803009128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“雪山之主是”有些好奇"}
{"time": 1753709432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777650657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沿着右侧一路上行，岩壁上偶尔伸出些许透明的晶块，有些带着深红的晶丝，如同火山的血管，也有一些清澈透亮，照上光的话折射出太阳般的光晕。\n很快左侧的岩壁也封上，甬道转向半封闭。"}
{"time": 1753709565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383417089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“学名叫冰咒的古龙哦？”把挎包里的笔记本拿出来递给露儿，“你找一下，应该有不少记录。”"}
{"time": 1753709593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312222284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不会要我来编吧）"}
{"time": 1753709605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167837833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以过聆听）"}
{"time": 1753709696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197858736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+2"}
{"time": 1753709696, "type": "reply", "message_id": "197858736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]演奏出: 1D20+2={10}+2=12"}
{"time": 1753709772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737057812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1383417089]记录的内容，自在地操纵寒气，释放超低温的吐息，让空无一物的空间出现巨大冰块或冰墙。其超低温的吐息威力巨大，甚至能冰冻大型怪物乃至熔岩，双翼四足的冰蓝古龙，下面批注，“似乎是自认为我的监护人。”"}
{"time": 1753710450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77961539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "。rd+2"}
{"time": 1753710450, "type": "reply", "message_id": "77961539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D20+2={17}+2=19"}
{"time": 1753710462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1671675808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=737057812]（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1753710500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006829277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害....,安姐姐身边好多厉害的人啊”"}
{"time": 1753710668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034963529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "甬道上方有些许骚动，不像大体型的怪物，而是小体型的生物。也许已经离开碎龙的活动范围了"}
{"time": 1753710746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172462376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1006829277]“嗯...这家伙态度恶劣啦，诺，笔记上也写了吧，她觉得自己是...妈妈...”偏过头，“很难为情啊”"}
{"time": 1753710754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923161942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“明明之前没见过...”"}
{"time": 1753710838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043050891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妈妈吗？露儿没有妈妈，不太懂正常母女怎么相处的，不过她肯定很关心你吧”"}
{"time": 1753710976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072934428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛...十六岁之前我从没见过她哦?不声不响跑出来说是我的妈妈，这种事露儿想一想也不能接受吧？\"捂着脸，\"很奇怪吧？\""}
{"time": 1753711282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078613502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "托腮思考“这样的话，好像确实”"}
{"time": 1753711303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407251730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果现在忽然有个人跳出来说是我妈妈，我应该也会挺困扰的”"}
{"time": 1753711445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359483741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“反正彼此都是用后即弃的家伙”赫萝无所谓地耸肩“成年之后就各自在世界里消失了吧”"}
{"time": 1753711489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174426359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对吧？\"合上笔记塞回自己的挎包，\"我就是这种情况哦，更何况...我连父亲会扮演什么样的角色都不清楚。\"瞪一眼赫萝，\"刚刚才有些伤感，能不能不要插嘴。\""}
{"time": 1753711615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905639428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“干嘛，我在安慰你诶”赫萝翻了个白眼，快步接着朝上走了"}
{"time": 1753711690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839907990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...那我还真是略有些荣幸。\"带着些笑开口，\"不过...人类很讲究亲情的纽带啦，反正...我很看重。虽然我没有，嘛嘛。\""}
{"time": 1753711822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007378379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”点头表示认可“人类对各种感情都很看重呢”"}
{"time": 1753711994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387120746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"即使没有也会憧憬啦，不过...或许我也没那么不走运。\"意有所指，跟上脚步，声音不大但确保所有人都能听到\"我们也走吧?\""}
{"time": 1753712041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385247361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "上方的空间又开阔了起来，是个能容纳下一个广场的大平台。平台一侧有一条火红的河流，比起在下方见过的小熔岩湖，流量要大不少。而平台上有些臣蜘蛛和红速龙在互咬"}
{"time": 1753712210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704864907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇哦，要不要试试岩浆的温度?\""}
{"time": 1753712338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721108527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "指着熔岩河，\"听说这种的温度都不高啦，怎么样，很有意思的提案吧？\""}
{"time": 1753712375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "969627132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对着惊世骇俗的话有点害怕"}
{"time": 1753712403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235324076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"露儿?\"歪过头看她，\"试试吗？\""}
{"time": 1753712443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528752642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还是不了”连忙摆手“我只是个普通人，没有那种试试的胆量了...”"}
{"time": 1753712554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789643816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，没劲诶。\"往岩浆旁径直走过去"}
{"time": 1753712828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638761231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么可能不高（））"}
{"time": 1753712843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894106385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（外面那种黑黢黢的不高，但是这种亮红色的，嗯）"}
{"time": 1753712859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581986584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嚯啦。\"仗着有零玉靠在岩浆河的岸边"}
{"time": 1753712894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87718311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“该说不愧是安姐姐吗”擦擦冷汗"}
{"time": 1753712942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211299242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有些生物都可以在岩浆里游泳栖息来着，露儿也别害怕，过来过来\""}
{"time": 1753712994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580002048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....还是..算了吧”"}
{"time": 1753713143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773449352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉温度很正常啦。\"蹲下身，\"夏弥夏弥，快来。\""}
{"time": 1753713335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "436628944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你能不能不要趁我在打粥自顾自整出一些奇怪的动静）"}
{"time": 1753713431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417909537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=E44D17DAA27F9DF2B564CE1B64C3AE1A.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRl1nZ1n1DyHyZO1tlD9ouMmbqcMRiQ-AQg_woo09e00OPfjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQlll6Wga1u8lS3DTzUywdPXoCE-M&amp;rkey=CAESMJtZBhciwvC8U9cg2UQOpgOg_JnN-R9zsvFGZz_n-dJwbdJQUVYYnh9PPG-oSAPouA,file_size=80912]"}
{"time": 1753713450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898458389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(整点活)"}
{"time": 1753715704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709042320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（回来了，还活着吗都）"}
{"time": 1753715789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908157558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（在吧）"}
{"time": 1753716450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973669224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1753716823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624471847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（困）"}
{"time": 1753716924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594720818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1581986584]零玉靠近，岩浆的色泽确实暗淡不少，流速减缓接近凝固。现在看来其功效如同阻尼，周围环境温度越高，其能释放的冷气越多。如果鞋底够厚的话，也许短暂踏足也是可以的"}
{"time": 1753717124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941024806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1773449352]“你……稍微离远些啦，我先帮你试试再说”夏弥赶紧拽住你，拉到自己身后，先伸出金属化的右手摸摸那块逐渐减缓的熔岩"}
{"time": 1753717346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618662272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?如果在这多放一会的话...感觉会冷却得很厉害哦?\"在她身后探着脑袋，\"夏弥别急嘛，我只是起了玩心想试试这块玉，不是真的想跳下去游泳啦\""}
{"time": 1753761188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1444305189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1753761769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416409282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃个饭先)"}
