{"time": 1753771807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804981149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": ".rd+2"}
{"time": 1753771807, "type": "reply", "message_id": "804981149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]演奏出: 1D20+2={4}+2=6"}
{"time": 1753771969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133603315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就是全新的古龙种咯?\""}
{"time": 1753771984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696159033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我忍不住要去确认了\""}
{"time": 1753772114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682253313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "身后，臣蜘蛛群躁动起来，看起来已经解决了红速龙群。洞口处则传来另一阵更大的窸窣声，像是拖曳着什么"}
{"time": 1753772217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075318421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(15了？)"}
{"time": 1753772231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680684825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=682253313]\"又是什么..?\""}
{"time": 1753772248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899531283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉，\"小心一些，感觉有不妙的东西过来了\""}
{"time": 1753772285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199611752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会是斩龙吧...”"}
{"time": 1753772390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078740047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呃...这两家伙的栖息地不会挨在一起吧？”"}
{"time": 1753772482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063481858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之先看看是什么家伙来了"}
{"time": 1753772565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068711977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "洞口处先冒出几只洁白的臣蜘蛛，随后一头大的多、结构也明显不一样的节肢动物钻过洞口。四条裹着丝线的蛛腿修长，折叠之后也依旧高过头胸，头部下沉，层层叠叠覆盖着白色蛛网的腹部翘起，身后拖着两头被裹得严实的装甲草食龙"}
{"time": 1753772691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490522514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过不管丝线编织的绢衣多么华贵，面目总是狰狞的"}
{"time": 1753772695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218421876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=11439CFFF1C59B863FC57A309012C8DF.jpeg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR8RehV5PmJJMnBza3QWwCvnwN-ShjcuEMg_woo26TKs8DhjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQofxT4TvWjgnnamFYRkQlW3oCVsU&amp;rkey=CAMSMGPtKDnfdZIpmT51PPUpbDL06Fd5vtVaYJ9duAXF8Be2xptvyvtOssfrBMx-QDIMRA,file_size=1104988]"}
{"time": 1753772712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464683027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是我的衣服)"}
{"time": 1753772881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205740965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这就是我的目标哦\""}
{"time": 1753772954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139055101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谎言纤毫毕现，生命脆若游丝（）"}
{"time": 1753772979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954651127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来臣蜘蛛为什么没来打你们（）"}
{"time": 1753773026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483979546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不知道啊)"}
{"time": 1753773048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924649087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是在打红速龙（）"}
{"time": 1753773131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641675219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是妃蜘蛛大概没有臣蜘蛛那么好说话，她发现外敌之后便短暂伸长脖颈，立起颈部，发出很符合鬼叫定义的嘶鸣"}
{"time": 1753773153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664768322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼，夏弥，喜欢那些丝吗？\""}
{"time": 1753773206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715172732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但其实和棉花会有什么本质区别吗？）"}
{"time": 1753773223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626531132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能会（）"}
