{"time": 1753773344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080374843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不错诶”夏弥靠在你旁边，眯着眼打量着“好纯的色……而且纤维好细，织成单层的布的话……应该会好……透”"}
{"time": 1753773368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378730677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（邪恶拔刀人）"}
