{"time": 1753779247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859378738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我已经好久没见过我的二阶段了）"}
{"time": 1753779273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606494020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，这些蜘蛛类的怪物的丝线是最值钱的部分，其次应该是甲壳，不过我们既然没有狩猎的打算，甲壳...就不取了吧。\""}
{"time": 1753783210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331043835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "妃蜘蛛无力反抗，体内也没有针对催眠的抗性，很快就动弹不得，陷入晕厥。不过它也没有眼皮，总归怪渗人的"}
{"time": 1753784304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402605447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...看着还挺吓人的。\"靠上前，触碰一下足肢上缠绕的丝线。"}
{"time": 1753784501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958222056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不知道还会不会遇到什么突发事件，沧澜，你还好吗，之前好像也受了伤”背好太刀看向沧澜询问"}
{"time": 1753784522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466361519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概并不是每根丝线都有粘性，也有一些直接挂在肢体上的刺钩上。看着韧性极强，强风之下也没有绷断多少。连在一起，引着光照，隐隐有虹光流转"}
{"time": 1753784970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943029978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"绮丽啊..\"勾起一些带着虹光的丝线，\"露儿，我们应该用不了太多，你需要吗？\""}
{"time": 1753785025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999842314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我吗？”"}
{"time": 1753785034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608298071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢安姐姐....”"}
{"time": 1753785106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067793254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1958222056]“没什么事”她仰头喝下一瓶药“它也没冲着我来”"}
{"time": 1753785127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956483304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不卖的话，拿去做衣服也不错啦。\"动手开始剥取缠绕在其身上的丝线，\"还要带回结云...\""}
{"time": 1753785221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106546054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那我也去收集一点线吧"}
{"time": 1753785537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037389448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们慢慢盘剥妃蜘蛛身上的白丝，大片的扒成布匹，小片的缠成线轴（有吗）。最后算下来，还没剥完，已经有了个六七平"}
{"time": 1753785682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672270871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "知晓妃蜘蛛的丝线完全是可再生这一事实，干脆一做不二不休，全部剥下来"}
