{"time": 1753786031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631099887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...带着这些丝线探索的话，有些耽误...”想来天色也晚了，“今天先回营地吧？”"}
