{"time": 1753786942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260406480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我十几号才返校）"}
{"time": 1753787031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253685020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=631099887]“嗯哼，先原路返回吧。刚刚我好像听到谁的肚子在叫来着”夏弥吹起一块白帛，手里还摩挲着一小块，看着心情相当好"}
{"time": 1753787173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695054162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253685020]“诶...我没有”矢口否认，脸撇向一边，“只是有一点饿了，一点点。”"}
{"time": 1753787439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196772088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀，我没听清是谁的说？”夏弥得逞般轻笑，走到前面去了"}
{"time": 1753787601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228189297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她们之前是不是提到了婚纱？”沧澜跟在露儿旁边，小声询问"}
{"time": 1753787637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267126515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对哦，夏弥姐姐和安姐姐要结婚来着”"}
{"time": 1753787697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838842350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“女性和女性？”沧澜头上冒出个问号"}
{"time": 1753787982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896305868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"反正肯定不是我。\"轻哼一声，追上去走在一起，\"我明明有好好忍着的。\""}
{"time": 1753788082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239989341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感情够好的话性别不是什么问题”"}
{"time": 1753788187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546620276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那后代怎么办？”沧澜离前面的人稍微远了些，大概是怕被听见"}
{"time": 1753788222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857518640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实...”神秘的说“人类相同性别也可以生孩子”"}
{"time": 1753788278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068500391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1753788297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604418920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”她瞪大了眼睛"}
{"time": 1753788355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547578168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1753788359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170826399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（还有这种事）"}
{"time": 1753788364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507487491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈，开个玩笑啦”"}
{"time": 1753788393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666451975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有的世界观可以，比如女生喜欢的什么abo）"}
{"time": 1753788552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954512629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟不是每个人都想要孩子”"}
{"time": 1753788565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532755785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且如果她们喜欢的话，也可以去领养一个孩子”"}
{"time": 1753788671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170058020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……吓我一跳”沧澜的五官归位，回到风平浪静的样子“只是问问，我也没有想过这种事情。先回去吧”"}
{"time": 1753788719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771351863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“原来沧澜也有这种表情啊”"}
{"time": 1753788789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098895555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么？”沧澜走在前面"}
{"time": 1753788874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539661830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟平常感觉你基本没什么表情的样子”"}
{"time": 1753789202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337123672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我没有刻意维持”她摇头，你只能看见她的蓝发摇摆"}
{"time": 1753789264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "797147847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“什么样的沧澜都很可爱呢”"}
{"time": 1753789589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710426130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可爱吗？露儿是这么想的”她转过头来，依旧没什么表情"}
{"time": 1753789635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433669362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还以为会有威风一点的形容”"}
{"time": 1753789764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672216733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜当然也很帅气啊”"}
{"time": 1753789815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933435231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过刚刚那个表情确实很可爱么”"}
{"time": 1753789815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034157686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好人机）"}
{"time": 1753790042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126856912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好朋友吧）"}
{"time": 1753790059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "20244065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是吗，虽然不理解点在哪”沧澜摇摇头“以后可以试试”"}
{"time": 1753790718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943076198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（时点结束了吗，该插动了）"}
{"time": 1753790744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236107894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟沧澜很漂亮么”点赞"}
{"time": 1753790764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332316586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那句话怎么说来着，颜值即正义”"}
{"time": 1753790950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31292206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（想干啥干啥啊）"}
{"time": 1753791139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194014140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好啦。”回过头看身后的两人，“不要讲悄悄话啦，难道你们都是铁打的？根本不饿吗”"}
{"time": 1753791221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875327402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“虽然自己承认很怪。”瞪一眼夏弥，掐掐她的手臂，“饿了啦，有带什么吃的吗?"}
{"time": 1753791419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629951562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（和哈吉弥有什么关系）"}
{"time": 1753791455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691245347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（她不提我就一直不说，jpg）"}
{"time": 1753791721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432736590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么问我啦”夏弥哭笑不得，转而抱起白，掂掂它的背包“小白，你有带吃的吗？”"}
{"time": 1753791780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999573384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哼。”松开手，“还不都是夏弥非要开我的玩笑，现在这叫恶果啦。”点点脑袋"}
{"time": 1753791816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633667481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只带了些肉干喵，炎火村的便当有点……”"}
{"time": 1753791952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366785582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我懂我懂的，全是丸子对吧？”深有同感地点着头，“虽然不是不好吃，但是吃多了难免难受吧”"}
{"time": 1753792154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296533267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（回个家）"}
{"time": 1753792182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271025241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唔嗯，siro，附近有没有别的食材啦，今天想吃点好一点的东西。”苦着脸"}
{"time": 1753792599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152747489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“用岩浆烤鱼会不会更好吃呢”沉思"}
{"time": 1753792831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828404268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1271025241]“我真没有……”夏弥嘟嘴“而且人家只是提醒你好好吃饭嘛”\n“这里也……没什么能吃的食材喵，只有怪物了喵”白想了想一路走来的收获"}
{"time": 1753792937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245758888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1152747489]（哪有鱼）"}
