{"time": 1753793834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266035401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会是岩浆鱼呢”"}
{"time": 1753793896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269712070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"会在岩浆里游泳的鱼...我倒是有点印象...\"拉着夏弥往后退一退，\"露儿，离远一点。\""}
{"time": 1753793954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428953770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可能是泥龙鱼的表亲?是的话待会岩浆会溅得到处都是\""}
{"time": 1753794128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536649783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“ohoh”"}
{"time": 1753794138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767990243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拉着沧澜往后退"}
{"time": 1753794154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428963640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那这种鱼怎么弄熟呢”"}
{"time": 1753794172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601915481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟能在岩浆游泳”"}
{"time": 1753794301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833400286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"切开表皮?嗯...如果是的话，露儿想拿来练练手也不错?\"迟疑，\"但是这家伙看见情况不对会躲进岩浆...感觉不能指望这家伙当晚餐呢\""}
{"time": 1753794387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980659362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后是沉闷的滑动声。随后湖面缓缓凸起一块"}
{"time": 1753794516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289699759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1833400286]“为什么？我还挺感兴趣的”赫萝盯着异动的岩浆"}
{"time": 1753794593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210688657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摊摊手，\"赫萝要是有兴趣，那晚餐倒是有着落了，但是露儿要练手的话...得小心四处飞溅的岩浆。\"探过头看看是不是一条鱼出来了"}
{"time": 1753794721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757559323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大概是的）"}
{"time": 1753794841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525751436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去呆头呆脑的。\""}
{"time": 1753794853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101916284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，岩浆探头经典画面?)"}
{"time": 1753794912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471673992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一条体型庞大，双目泛白宛如熟鱼眼的黢黑鱼头探出湖面，一对鲜红的腮鼓动，乍一看倒是有点像眼睛"}
{"time": 1753794959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787542265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对于可能要沾到岩浆的战斗敬谢不敏，看向露儿，\"小露儿怎么说?赫萝大概是按耐不住想吃晚餐了。\""}
{"time": 1753794964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725571819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“赫萝姐姐来吧”"}
