{"time": 1753795361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702337244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦赫萝了，优先保证不要受伤哦?\"对露儿点点头，拉着夏弥往洞外走"}
{"time": 1753795418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896283860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "带着沧澜出去喵"}
{"time": 1753795478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991230442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎其实，也许，这玩意能吃鱼生？）"}
{"time": 1753795565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467107570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉确实)"}
{"time": 1753795571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481952433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(毕竟干净卫生)"}
{"time": 1753795690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636373262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，你们出去之后，便只能听见洞内传来的阵阵尖锐爆鸣。洞口透出的光亮中，红光闪耀的时长压倒性地胜过火光散发的时长。虽然熔岩龙在防御上比起碎龙也差不了多少，但想来不会有多少悬念"}
{"time": 1753795777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311467697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（设定里没有说过肉质啊，完全）"}
{"time": 1753795799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215725040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我只知道会弹白斩)"}
