{"time": 1753806829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705702949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我饭量除了发射激光那天，好像都挺平常的”思绪转了回来，一定要好好向沧澜道歉"}
{"time": 1753806933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596851669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吐出口气，\"现在倒是有了些线索。\""}
