{"time": 1753811749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155615500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1218458690]\"嗯...\"闭上双眼，跟着她的手的引导吻上去，\"喜欢...\"嘟囔不清"}
