{"time": 1753875685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312661903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=731724552]她用刀片盛着鱼肉，去岩浆上慢慢炙烤，同样处理掉焦化层，拿着放到你嘴边“啊~”"}
{"time": 1753875719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "197959441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至于赫萝，早就吃完了"}
{"time": 1753875824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984171689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=312661903]“嗷呜。”凑上前轻轻咬一口鱼肉，捧着自己的脸颊感叹，“嗯嗯..感觉味道都变好了。”"}
{"time": 1753876145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449565916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥呢?有没有吃饱...\"充满期待地看着她，\"我也想投喂...试试...\""}
