{"time": 1753876811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506895787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=449565916]“唔？”夏弥确实没怎么吃，不如说罪魁祸首就在眼前“想试就试呗”"}
{"time": 1753876952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454094704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506895787]\"哼哼...\"叼着鱼肉凑到她身前，期待地点点脑袋"}
