{"time": 1753879627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639127737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "嚼嚼嚼"}
{"time": 1753879660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507886360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之吃完了，人鱼龙也渐渐凉下来，不过离变成“室温”还有点距离"}
{"time": 1753879924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598753265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，剩下的就送回岩浆里吧？今天这么晚了，是不是该回去了?\"对着露儿招招手，\"走吗？\""}
{"time": 1753880339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356596677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，我本来也没什么事情”"}
