{"time": 1753880786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998905814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吃都吃了)"}
{"time": 1753880802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183147031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我们就一起走吧。\"拉着夏弥往营地走"}
{"time": 1753880879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35273178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟上"}
{"time": 1753881206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830264954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "出洞，外面仅剩火山口一处光源，真可称得上昏天黑地。星月都被遮蔽，没有植被覆盖导致地表温度在夜里居然不觉得炎热。不过夜空中偶有双翼鼓动的声音，不知道究竟来自何物"}
{"time": 1753881316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417266941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "地面上也说不上安宁，看来这附近的家伙生物钟都不太规律"}
{"time": 1753881322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689636605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想着可能是小翼龙之类的东西，打个哈欠，一边看着手里凌乱的地图，一边开口，\"想到还有这么多地方没勘探，感觉就好麻烦...\""}
{"time": 1753881393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156374746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在是找个安全的地方休息吗？”"}
{"time": 1753881604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42659358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689636605]“嘛嘛，反正只要有你在，我是在哪都差不多……说起来，这次的报酬应该不少？”夏弥捏捏你的肩膀“毕竟可能要干掉不少怪物……”"}
{"time": 1753881689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777224288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"回营地就好了啦，建在那个地方就代表大概是安全的?\"舒服地眯了眯眼，\"报酬的话应该蛮丰富的?嘛...最大的收获还是这些丝线吧？夏弥。\""}
{"time": 1753882079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253564907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……我都在想先回一趟结云的事情了”夏弥带着那批丝线“来回一趟……也要不了很久。而且露儿已经满载了吧”"}
{"time": 1753882328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323737103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那麻烦夏弥姐姐了”"}
{"time": 1753882371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232585274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我也没意见啦。\""}
{"time": 1753882386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670417119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那..我是留在这边还是一起啦\"\""}
{"time": 1753883032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433274125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你问谁啊）"}
