{"time": 1753883093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954475398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是为什么要问我（））"}
{"time": 1753883115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749242321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不一起的话总归有点不放心（）”"}
{"time": 1753883278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014534290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...好吧，那看来在这边的调查要暂时延期了。\"收拾一下东西，\"露儿正好也能回去看看家里?\""}
{"time": 1753883427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211959915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人家也没有要求你一次全探清）"}
