{"time": 1753887358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127964641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那个转圈的龙）"}
{"time": 1753887454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570202965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那个一般啦）"}
{"time": 1753887475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428475525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1753887593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029774129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之到了，此时灯火幽微，只有少数几间屋子亮着"}
{"time": 1753887641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057676306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "集会所也是其中之一"}
{"time": 1753887690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753001244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我们就在集会所落脚来着？我记得是小觉开的房间吧？”有些困倦"}
{"time": 1753887853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599327283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，没错，钥匙在安身上的吧？”夏弥附和"}
{"time": 1753887873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626044378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“觉姐姐开了几个房间呢”"}
{"time": 1753887947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735121515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“应该和在结云时一样吧？”夏弥思索"}
{"time": 1753887977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516568490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，不过给露儿似乎只开了一间房？”如是说"}
{"time": 1753887998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061935761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像还真是）"}
{"time": 1753888132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566480881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些促狭地看向露儿，“可以吗？小露儿。”"}
{"time": 1753888144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951811319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我和沧澜挤一下也没什么事吗”"}
{"time": 1753888159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602385237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟有床睡已经很好了”"}
{"time": 1753888164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198019014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=951811319]（吧）"}
{"time": 1753888177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003148319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不想挤可以再开一间啊）"}
{"time": 1753888181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575319377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“或者好像现在在开一间也不一定来不及”"}
{"time": 1753888193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634299996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么说”看向沧澜询问"}
{"time": 1753888202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499699365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2003148319]（你打字有点快）"}
{"time": 1753888252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401931996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634299996]“我都行”她摇头，随后开始找还开着的杂货铺"}
{"time": 1753888285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274852840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那挤一下吧，还能省点钱”"}
{"time": 1753888301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709602142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛，现在的情况再开一间也可以，不过...随便露儿和沧澜决定咯？对了，露儿记得处理一下素材。”随后走去集会所的前台，看向水芸开口，“贵安，关于火山的调查，我想请问要做到什么程度。”"}
{"time": 1753888304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095212175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刀是明天交的吗）"}
{"time": 1753888349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741329481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看眼铁匠铺还开着吗"}
{"time": 1753888534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804811230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1709602142]你来到前台，接待员不是先前那一位龙人，而是一名普通人类。她应了你的问题，翻看一番“整个火山地区都可以调查，公会方会依据调查结果评估报酬”"}
{"time": 1753888554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543427055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=741329481]关着，想来铁匠也是要睡觉的"}
{"time": 1753888606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676896300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=804811230]\"原来如此，那在调查期间进行的狩猎，公会方会提供相应的报酬吗？\"表达感谢之后继续开口询问"}
{"time": 1753888756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994423092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "动用我的猎人常识，如果我在第二天重新给出刀新的材料，之前那把已经锻好的刀可不可以不要了，甚至不付前一把刀的钱"}
{"time": 1753888810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363464492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1676896300]（真是个好问题）"}
{"time": 1753888822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265417954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1994423092][CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 显然不能啊"}
{"time": 1753888861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399123528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就是那把刀我只能花6k买了是吧（）"}
{"time": 1753888874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262541923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（如果我不付钱的话会被拉进黑名单）"}
{"time": 1753889005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128829577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(按照现实生活来看好像是我会付定金，然后东西我不要了就定金不退了"}
{"time": 1753889014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892826712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是怪猎世界不收定金）"}
{"time": 1753889037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981495891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1676896300]“如果狩猎的目标的生态既足以对其他调查队伍造成伤害，其缺失又不至于严重影响生态，公会会视作发布了委托”"}
{"time": 1753889106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888814063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=262541923]（不付钱你就没有刀了啊，你不是交了一半）"}
{"time": 1753889121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072374078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过你可以卖了）"}
{"time": 1753889194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581552430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888814063]（好像没交一半吧）"}
