{"time": 1753889243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411587451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=981495891]\"嗯...\"点点头，\"我明白了，冒昧深夜打扰，有劳了。\"表达感谢之后帮着夏弥抱起一部分收集的丝，\"回去休息啦！～\""}
{"time": 1753889246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346215613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦还真没有）"}
{"time": 1753889347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676970939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但你不买就亏材料）"}
