{"time": 1753890184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557172804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=911277763]“中午……哦”赫萝打了个哈欠，看起来今天也挺累的“行……也可以不叫”"}
