{"time": 1753927612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776587461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(吸气的时候有可能吧？)"}
{"time": 1753928038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979687003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "换上睡衣，然后趴床上研究买的那本书"}
{"time": 1753928303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012444952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2002689420]“哎呀……”夏弥托着你的腋下，把你抬起来一些“实在不行的话今天洗的草率一点也可以……”"}
{"time": 1753928550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81649800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=979687003]大致讲述了纺织方面的基本知识和技巧。不过蜘蛛丝这种纤细的材质，如果想要织成围巾，就得编成毛线，需求的量有些大的过分。大概只能用织机来织成丝巾"}
{"time": 1753928858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068394047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1012444952]\"嗯...\"身体软软地依托着她的双手，\"再泡一会啦...有夏弥看着吧...\""}
