{"time": 1753933156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599738893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“干的差不多了吗”看会书后询问沧澜，然后拍拍床"}
{"time": 1753933619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269565531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=599738893]“嗯”她站起来，走到床边趴下"}
{"time": 1753933654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236302857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心翼翼的上药，顺便观察一下伤口情况"}
{"time": 1753933913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509085283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=236302857]非要说就是已经不需要小心翼翼了。有一部分已经健康地脱了痂，露出其下的新生皮。不过还有一些，似乎是因为受到冲击、脱痂过早。导致流血结了新痂"}
{"time": 1753934045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333051109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉再过两三天就应该彻底好了，不知道会不会留疤..应该问问蝴蝶医生有没有不留疤的药来着”"}
{"time": 1753934237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781587580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这种程度的伤口，不留疤才奇怪”沧澜倒是一副无所谓的样子"}
{"time": 1753935085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881993544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "上完药“时间差不多了”打个哈欠“该睡觉了，晚安沧澜”"}
{"time": 1753935418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007766986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“晚安”她钻进被子里，弄得被窝似乎都更软了些"}
