{"time": 1753938289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68869831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也行）"}
{"time": 1753938412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236643001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "疲惫但充实的一日过去，今晚注定要如泥酣眠。旁边睡着另外一个人的感觉格外微妙，不知你是否会为此有些许失眠"}
{"time": 1753938445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98567202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但你越是介意，就入睡越晚，睡得自然也会更沉"}
{"time": 1753938539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678499786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过沧澜不会介意，她的呼吸如同风平浪静的海面，规律，平稳。但你的记忆中，属于炽热的那部分莫名地苏醒"}
{"time": 1753938714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070510784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许是今日与火山打了太多交道，你总觉得这床铺格外燥热"}
{"time": 1753938819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434967248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好热....”"}
