{"time": 1753939044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "87858503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（脱衣服难道是很简单的动作吗（）"}
{"time": 1753939069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001296732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "踢被子"}
{"time": 1753939216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196525322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "燥热没有因此得到缓解。它与环境无关，不来自体外，而来自你自己也不熟悉的体内"}
{"time": 1753939259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861711966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看，它的温度又升高。现在是多少？60？70？或许对你来说，还不至于受伤。但没有停下的趋势"}
{"time": 1753939270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678982843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你醒不过来，这是个要人命的噩梦"}
{"time": 1753939284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205806702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好热.....要死了....”"}
{"time": 1753939359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336522579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“冰的东西...”四处乱摸，试图找到凉快的东西"}
{"time": 1753939434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59854466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "温度继续上升，你听到大片水域沸腾的声音，亿万气泡升腾，化作水汽升空，没入那片不知何时而来的黑云。如果只是沸水，也许你还能坚持得住"}
{"time": 1753939476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948837891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336522579]（摸啥呢（）"}
{"time": 1753939491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155885712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（反正就挣扎吧）"}
{"time": 1753939602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738665556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=59854466]但可惜不只是如此。因为太阳从那移动的火山中喷出，落入你的海疆、你的栖所。"}
{"time": 1753939791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564637683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1948837891]（说不定就摸到沧澜了，感觉她冰冰的[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1753939812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781333068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要逃跑...."}
{"time": 1753939860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538150591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许只有这时候，你才会痛恨你的肢体的生命力如此顽强。倘若痛觉神经在被熔岩吞没的刹那就能死去，那也不必承担熔毁般的痛苦……你终于从炼狱中醒来，死亡解脱了你，发现自己已经爬下了床，以四肢着地的方式朝着房间的东南角瑟缩。有人的手搭上了你的肩膀"}
{"time": 1753939904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381113820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谁...”害怕的看过去"}
{"time": 1753939940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514114434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我，你怎么了？”房间里没开灯，不过你能认出她的轮廓"}
{"time": 1753940037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283897108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜啊...”长舒一口气“我..做了个噩梦，好恐怖”想到那股灼烧的感觉，紧紧蜷缩在一起“好热，好痛...”"}
{"time": 1753940274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598078214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“梦……”她轻轻拍着你的肩膀，后又改成抚摸你的脑袋，似乎在思考安慰的词句“……别怕，只是梦而已。是不是因为去了火山？”"}
{"time": 1753940376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186285347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...不知道，我好像梦见了火山爆发...然后...”一回想就感觉痛苦的不得了，一股后怕的感觉"}
{"time": 1753940598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296124764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没事的，火山离我们很远”她没有拉你起来，而是蹲下来。昏暗的室内，隐约的反倒清晰起来。而你的体温无疑还是正常的“……不要想它了”"}
{"time": 1753940688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970529919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...你说的对，只是一场梦而已...而且还有沧澜在，抱歉，打扰到你了，我们继续去休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1753940705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593235454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我只能说藏了情报）"}
