{"time": 1753960694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123511511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看着有些黑眼圈，不过不算重"}
{"time": 1753960748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568344937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨天安姐姐不是问我有什么做什么梦么...”"}
{"time": 1753960838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419120968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨晚...我做了个噩梦..”一想起来就浑身发抖，仿佛那灼烧感还存在一般，感觉要瘫坐在地上了"}
{"time": 1753960918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558117064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尽管还穿着睡衣，上前扶住她，拉她进屋，\"别急...慢慢说。\""}
{"time": 1753960964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208470241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢...安姐姐”努力去忘记那种感觉"}
{"time": 1753961089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93941261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦呀，难道是那种……”夏弥去前台要了壶热水回来"}
{"time": 1753961249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182155626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扶她到沙发上坐下，\"嗯...我在听。\""}
{"time": 1753961267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252107562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢坐下，深呼吸，努力让自己保平静的回忆“我好像当时是在海里...”"}
{"time": 1753961298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789297817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身接过夏弥带回来的热水壶，倒三杯热水，先递给夏弥，然后递给露儿，最后自己捧一杯拉着夏弥坐在床上"}
{"time": 1753961456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143645791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后，我感觉好热............周围的水汽都在蒸发...汇到天上的乌云里...梦里的我身体强度好像还蛮好的，正常应该勉强可以忍受...”"}
{"time": 1753961670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378515203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是.....但是”回想到这里，仿佛又感觉到了那股灼烧感，身体微微发抖“附近的火山..不知道喷出一个什么东西，就像太阳一样....”"}
{"time": 1753961730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578853390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看到她在颤抖，走上前轻轻抱住坐着的露儿，\"没关系没关系...我们在这里...\""}
{"time": 1753961745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397630967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然只是场梦，但回忆到这里已经头上满满的汗珠了“抱歉...剩下的，大概就是我被活活烧死了，那感觉太痛苦了...我不太想回忆了....”"}
{"time": 1753961781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914599542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（果然没说到重点.jpg）"}
{"time": 1753961801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619701135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想的其实是露儿露儿乖，坏人都被打跑了)"}
{"time": 1753961867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494223553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...感觉是一个普通的噩梦?\""}
{"time": 1753961902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "823145479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=914599542]（我感觉基本信息都概括完了吧，总不能重点是我顽强的生命力？）"}
{"time": 1753961923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230544104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你说的都不是重点）"}
{"time": 1753961947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340444091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那火山好像还会移动....确实很有种梦的感觉...”"}
{"time": 1753962010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955917603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...那种被灼烧的感觉 又不像一个普通的梦...”"}
{"time": 1753962195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106757901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"会移动的火山?会不会是露儿昨天白天去了火山，晚上才会做噩梦啦\""}
{"time": 1753962200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786612823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7533210287454771496]"}
