{"time": 1753963015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985011811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，露儿还有什么补充吗？\"松开抱住她安抚的手，坐回床上"}
{"time": 1753963033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837806661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "顺便回忆一下一开始温度的升高是因为火山靠的越来越近吗"}
{"time": 1753963124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814858429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "或许是，或许不是。但那只是一种印象"}
{"time": 1753963141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711713908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许不是火山呢"}
{"time": 1753963157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200390331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（移动的火山其实我觉得是条龙）"}
{"time": 1753963167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646249372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在等安告诉我是什么龙（）"}
{"time": 1753963189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888124542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你得先开口吧)"}
{"time": 1753963194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010698535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个火山...会不会是一条很大很大的龙呢..”"}
{"time": 1753963331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539516318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "表情认真起来，\"我一直很重视梦啦。露儿说的...\""}
{"time": 1753963358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073507329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"记不记得之前在熔岩河旁边我跟你提过的，我以前做过的梦?\""}
{"time": 1753963456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942296855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1645887438]“黑色怪物吗？”"}
{"time": 1753963663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244545851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，有没有觉得，很相似?\""}
{"time": 1753963684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596438735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "喝口热水，仿佛像是要通过水温确认什么"}
{"time": 1753963795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801669100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "完全不同的热感，那份灼热与现实无关，或许也与生命无关"}
{"time": 1753963953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343829916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想喝口水压压惊，但看见蒸腾的热气感觉有点害怕，还是不喝了"}
{"time": 1753963988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014921754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...如果那是龙的话...没有这种存在的记载哦，露儿。但是，我总觉得它是真实存在的...\"水杯捧在手里，提起这个话题自己也有些发抖，求助地看向夏弥"}
{"time": 1753964094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497724923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "夏弥轻轻握住你的手，传递着她稳定的体温“别怕……我会一直陪着你的。而且安可是高天上的神明呐？”"}
{"time": 1753964129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311977285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且……你们两个的相遇，说不定，会带来转机呐”"}
{"time": 1753964258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336768565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"感受着她的体温，深吸一口气，继续开口，\"我想，那个梦可能并不是梦，而是，已经发生的现实?或者说...迄今为止所有类似的梦，都是已经发生的事情。\""}
{"time": 1753964354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371052569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "预言？记忆？幻觉？暗示？总之，过分身临其境的体感，不可能是梦可以概括是"}
{"time": 1753964416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137239065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但其实还有东西）"}
{"time": 1753964465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993782897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...露儿告诉我，你是在海里吗？\""}
{"time": 1753964483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53857893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”"}
{"time": 1753964569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "16374246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔嗯...\"看向夏弥，弱弱的开口\"天被击坠，海被煮沸...如果是真的，那家伙是不是太厉害了一点?\""}
{"time": 1753964859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943957582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“应该……不会吧？如果真的有那么强大的家伙，怎么会发现不了……”夏弥甩甩脑袋"}
{"time": 1753965059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254011747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...可能现在没有到出现的时机?\"有些怀疑这句话，\"但是梦境是现实的话...应该已经发生过了才对?\"看向露儿"}
