{"time": 1753969409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869081752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么）"}
{"time": 1753969529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140592571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那不是先杀到灵峰)"}
{"time": 1753969546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614882909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（妹说）"}
{"time": 1753969729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769680795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不知道从哪里出来对不对）"}
{"time": 1753969744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366109801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说是这么说，但是从西北面来，很容易就这么觉得了吧)"}
{"time": 1753969794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475383986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不也是先入海么）"}
{"time": 1753969937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778147090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对他来说没差啦，走哪没哪)"}
{"time": 1753970513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40026887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...现在想这些事也无济于补吧，小露儿。”站起身摸摸头，“而且比起梦境中独自面对的场景...现在我们不是在一起吗？”安抚的笑容"}
{"time": 1753970887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177149409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...安姐姐说的对”"}
{"time": 1753971120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777129977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...我现在越想越觉得露儿说得前世什么的可能是真的啦?\"停下摸头的动作，\"嗯...有一个作证?也许算?\"眯起眼"}
{"time": 1753971372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123483239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么？”夏弥久违地插嘴"}
{"time": 1753971425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782237407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来打错字了，佐证)"}
{"time": 1753971544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294629671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"秋玥之前提到的冥河?\"摊摊手，\"总之是摆渡的事情吧？\"一边翻动回忆一边开口，\"她作为监护人，被什么规则束缚着也大概能算?虽然我没有什么印象，如果信的话...感觉前世说站得住脚?\""}
{"time": 1753971970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710659690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……秋玥女士当时的表现……”夏弥也昂着脑袋回忆“也许你们确实，不太正常……好吧，早就不太正常了，只是不知道有多不正常而已”"}
{"time": 1753972173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676216868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么说好过分哦，明明感觉很普通嘛。\"回身掐两下夏弥的脸颊，接着看向露儿，\"嗯...露儿自己接受吗？前世之类的。\""}
{"time": 1753972255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218580266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“前世...已经过去了吧”"}
{"time": 1753972617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962329802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，有一个疑点啦。\""}
{"time": 1753972715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751947319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "托着下巴垂眸开口，\"前世是前世啦...但是今生，如果算本体的话?那个...不是存在得好好的?\"皱眉"}
{"time": 1753973437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037190434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好复杂啊...”感觉有点头疼摇摇头"}
{"time": 1753973455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831937460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有1吗）"}
{"time": 1753973530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310131551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明天白天可以有)"}
{"time": 1753973534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186109952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，搞不清楚啦”夏弥叹气“虽然说不去想比较好，但总感觉头顶上悬着什么……令人不安”"}
{"time": 1753973637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322265880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不管是没有解决的当前事态，还是梦中预示的灾厄，倒是一个比一个麻烦啊。\"摊摊手，\"不过倒是能确定，露儿的那个正体?应该也在海里存在?\""}
{"time": 1753974700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636832215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（露儿呢）"}
{"time": 1753974709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045011587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1753974728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425436866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，之前就觉得应该在海里”"}
{"time": 1753974738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23459328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这次应该彻底确定了”"}
{"time": 1753974926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180681445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真有趣诶...不知道会是怎么样的生物?我之前推测过是水蛇来着?\""}
{"time": 1753974947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298891575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔嗯...触手吗？\"若有所思地看着露儿"}
{"time": 1753975172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36336550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门外有人敲门.jpg"}
{"time": 1753975259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576205880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?这个时候。\"起身，\"露儿好好想想哦?触手...\"走到门边回应，\"谁?\""}
{"time": 1753975470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106724348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我”沧澜的应答“露儿在你们这边吗？”"}
{"time": 1753975532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482862509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"打开门，打量一下她"}
{"time": 1753975610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971791673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在的在的”朝沧澜挥挥手"}
{"time": 1753975720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668230008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "穿着睡衣，还是那副面瘫样。不过能看到几个度的皱眉，但看到露儿后便解开了“那就好。我怕你又梦游了”"}
{"time": 1753975812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930298807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我留字条了来着，沧澜没看见吗”"}
{"time": 1753975819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286963121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉，让你担心了”"}
{"time": 1753975913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760066977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔嗯...我们正在谈一些事情，不过现在也差不多说完了，要我把露儿还给你吗?\""}
{"time": 1753975932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137906174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……是吗，我没来得及看到”她垂下眼睑“没事”"}
{"time": 1753975947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074892823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好奇怪的说法”头顶冒个小小的问号"}
{"time": 1753975949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428911160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洋溢着我懂我懂的笑容，让开门口的身位靠到门边"}
{"time": 1753975955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265653581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760066977]（指这个）"}
{"time": 1753976043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705025255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想问问安姐姐对那个梦有没有什么头绪，而且昨晚让你也没睡好，想让你多休息一下，就一个人来了”解释一下"}
{"time": 1753976094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147002336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的，没事就行……有什么结论吗？”她没有理会奇怪的说法"}
{"time": 1753976286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946531218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"摊摊手，\"确信了露儿其实是海中某种带触手的生物?算吗\""}
{"time": 1753976318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785773893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么实质性的进展，都是一些猜想...”"}
{"time": 1753976356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104358715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉触手一点也不帅....希望别是什么章鱼之类的东西”"}
{"time": 1753976399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978202627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“带触手，会发射激光……从来没有听过，而且怎么都联系不到一块”沧澜摇头"}
{"time": 1753976424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58749070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有触手的话就不是蛇了吧？\"思考，\"感觉是软体动物?\""}
{"time": 1753976447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402772063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么是触手？”"}
{"time": 1753976514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425682758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么是触手”复读到"}
{"time": 1753976515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929640661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"露儿自己描述的啦，触须?还是下放的肢体之类的...而且...\"停顿了一下开口，\"捕食也很像触手和口器吧？\""}
{"time": 1753976529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763792703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？我没提到过触须吧.. ”"}
{"time": 1753976623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356415535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...倒是我擅自联想了。\""}
{"time": 1753976658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967838173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...也不是没有可能?露儿回想一想梦里的身体的话...\""}
{"time": 1753976665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054114246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=34A411CD56DA3F6DF2495519119A3349.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAmXuOp7Ld8ctB2gzP9V3geIbhzBiqgAEg_wooouTvn7jnjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQXJKeRHszLIGNKH_dALxpRHoCSEE&amp;rkey=CAESMOtg5kTwVZp59N6qxowm6Lun7l7Qz2UGVWCPOjdz4vDhqQVtkpG-lCTiRcGjNyho-g,file_size=16426]"}
{"time": 1753976674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151399865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这样看着)"}
{"time": 1753976797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384481859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "仔细回忆，我在海里是个什么样子的呢"}
{"time": 1753976905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065969929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你会发现你的视力不是很好。而对自己的检视，你从没有做过。不过大概的确有触手"}
{"time": 1753976973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351280863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像不是很好看的样子，而且视力不怎么好，似乎确实有触手”有点懊恼"}
{"time": 1753977097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227993331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你希望自己是什么样子（）"}
{"time": 1753977099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258685997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摊摊手，\"推论正确哦?\""}
{"time": 1753977120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898564542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道，章鱼感觉确实不怎么好看）"}
{"time": 1753977132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042128421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙倒是感觉怎么样都不会丑）"}
{"time": 1753977146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180780708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1753977158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506980072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真的吗）"}
{"time": 1753977169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635730227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙也可能会丑）"}
{"time": 1753977180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832781237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但龙这个名字就比章鱼帅太多了（）"}
{"time": 1753977248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121081016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎lxl）"}
{"time": 1753977266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272833452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦，小露儿。\"转过身点点她鼻尖，\"不用这么沮丧，说不定是很帅气的生物?\""}
{"time": 1753977298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706603509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是当人比较好，我对现在的样子挺满意的”"}
{"time": 1753977312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455069863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不管怎么样，要见到才清楚吧?\"收回手，拉着她到沧澜身边，\"而且，现在这样也不错?\""}
{"time": 1753977397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040668115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还有什么想讨论的问题吗？\"摆摆手"}
{"time": 1753977463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568814977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有了吧，那我们什么时候出发回结云呢”"}
{"time": 1753977512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205859588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且我好像升级成上阶猎人的前提达到了，沧澜还差几只来着”心里算算"}
{"time": 1753977551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68065507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总感觉把我这里当成很方便的地方了。\"幽幽地开口吐槽"}
{"time": 1753977627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698917456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人鱼龙 算沧澜参与狩猎吗）"}
{"time": 1753977666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674392930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1753977672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107252849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你觉得呢）"}
{"time": 1753977709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614052127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我先去看看那个傻子饿没饿死。\"推着露儿和沧澜出门，关上门之前轻声对着门里开口，\"夏弥快换衣服啦。\""}
{"time": 1753977715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095689491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（狗龙王，人鱼龙，水兽，蜘蛛，桃毛兽，尾锤龙，眠鸟，天狗兽，彩鸟，碎龙）"}
{"time": 1753977731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938972963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1107252849]（我觉得算）"}
{"time": 1753977739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325749813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那沧澜还差两只）"}
{"time": 1753977783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900666178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算牛魔）"}
{"time": 1753977794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965092522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像还差3只沧澜也可以升阶了，那我先等等吧，到时候我们一起成为上位猎人”规划未来中"}
{"time": 1753977846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805310932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（干掉十只是获得考试资格）"}
{"time": 1753977913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863637346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯——嘛，是不是该穿不怕湿的衣服呢？”"}
{"time": 1753977972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454365406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=965092522]“上位……虽然不知道是什么”"}
{"time": 1753978031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693788543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“上位猎人的话，可以接一些更困难的任务，赚更多的钱，大概就这样吧”"}
{"time": 1753978043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304041871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，要遮严实一点哦?\"说完看着露儿在这算起自己的位阶，摊摊手，去看看绘梨衣，敲门，\"早上好?\""}
{"time": 1753978271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561597868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=693788543]“比碎龙还强？”沧澜思索，带着你往用餐区去"}
{"time": 1753978368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217215216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，不过现在碎龙那种任务我们只能跟着安姐姐一起做，成为上位猎人之后就可以自己接了”"}
{"time": 1753978486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590633705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=304041871]“中午好”里头的声音懒洋洋。明明是海龙种，但好像对下雨天也不是很感冒。不过没听到来开门的脚步声"}
{"time": 1753978583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802971400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别赖床啦！我都怀疑你这傻瓜饿死在床上了。\""}
{"time": 1753978597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564647666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1217215216]“嗯……只靠我们的话”她摸摸下巴“好像有点难”"}
{"time": 1753978686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573642744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1802971400]“我吃了早饭回来的，你要不要看看现在几点了”没开门你也想象得到她的白眼"}
{"time": 1753978692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116227174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们也不一定非要直接从那么难的任务开始啦”"}
{"time": 1753978714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047144630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正..”思考一下“上位猎人赚的钱肯定比下位高”"}
{"time": 1753978883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310185817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573642744]\"嘛，也不算很晚嘛...\"打个哈哈，\"你没事的话我就走咯，今天回一趟结云村，你有要从那边带的东西吗？\""}
{"time": 1753978934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420542218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1047144630]（花的也多对不对）"}
{"time": 1753979080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756824567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1310185817]“哦？你们要回结云？”里头的声音轻快起来，连着拖鞋的声一块，过来开了门。粉发看起来梳理过“我也要去”"}
{"time": 1753979278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261049775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看起来有好好打理嘛...不过我们今天中午就会回来，绘梨衣要去吗？\""}
{"time": 1753979329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608187653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1047144630]“嗯，钱……我还有不少”沧澜随口说道“你不够的话，可以先用我的”"}
{"time": 1753979380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210594083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1261049775]和她比起来自己显然就没怎么打理，头发是随意扎的马尾，穿着睡衣。"}
{"time": 1753979409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273239507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我倒也..没那么缺钱啦”底气有点不足“不过成为上位猎人总归是好的”"}
{"time": 1753979666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076131382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1261049775]“去，这边无聊得紧，吃的也不好”她看起来竟然有些跃跃欲试“也只有白木枭有点意思……”"}
{"time": 1753979761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523688992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1273239507]“都行，随你安排”"}
{"time": 1753979808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "720675768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1076131382]摊摊手，\"唔嗯...\"走进房间"}
{"time": 1753979818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169134090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来我有一个不得不弄清的问题)"}
{"time": 1753979851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220684038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(鳍会长出来吗)"}
