{"time": 1753979947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113979127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=720675768]坐在梳妆台前解掉随意扎的马尾，\"那之后，要和我们一起勘探火山吗？\""}
{"time": 1753979969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400750155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1220684038]（谁的）"}
