{"time": 1753980428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629324853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过感觉炎火的菜确实不如我们结云啊”小声"}
{"time": 1753980481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133113085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "菜单上依旧是精美的各色团子。早餐里团子的占比更多了。不过总归还有些饭团和热粥可选。此外，虽然没有温泉蛋，但茶叶蛋还是有的"}
{"time": 1753980490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010673337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1593541613]\"任务啦，而且其实也挺有趣?\"一边说一边对着镜子抬起手整理自己的头发，\"而且，有零玉在的话，不会很热的。干的话，倒是没什么办法啦。\""}
{"time": 1753980518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462279377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，来都来了”点些团子吃"}
{"time": 1753980577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563419624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...绘梨衣会做发型吗？\"看着镜子里的发型总有些不尽人意，转过头期待地看着她"}
{"time": 1753980730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981394291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1563419624]“看我干嘛，不会，只会梳头”她没好气瞪你一眼“泡泡要不要”"}
{"time": 1753980763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218848859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=462279377]（其实应该还有肉松的）"}
{"time": 1753980767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088580301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（咸口（）"}
{"time": 1753980983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883314170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=462279377]炎火村别的没有，团子管够。至少性价比这块挑不出毛病"}
{"time": 1753980991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040038232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1981394291]鼓鼓嘴，从梳妆台抽屉里拿几根红绳，在两边耳畔绑出漂亮的束发红色蝴蝶结，把梳子递给绘梨衣，\"那就帮我梳梳啦。\""}
{"time": 1753981083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832792160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你从人家的梳妆台里掏？）"}
{"time": 1753981085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814918529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:forward,id=7533291393954707679]"}
