{"time": 1753981129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910217226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这不是酒店供给的吗？)"}
{"time": 1753981143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840141582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我出门还带一套梳妆用具吗)"}
{"time": 1753981207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696726767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不会给发绳啊）"}
{"time": 1753981236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390726602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(和风村子大概有吧?)"}
{"time": 1753981242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743287768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(人人都绑点的)"}
{"time": 1753981504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903691049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2040038232]“你还真要啊”她有点无语，随手往你头发上糊了点泡沫，算是干洗“感觉是个很适合报仇的时间啊，安小姐”"}
{"time": 1753981713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480506367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883314170]（但是你要点什么的呢）"}
{"time": 1753981749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609436886", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "就点些团子吃，然后来碗粥"}
{"time": 1753981770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380542827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1903691049]对着镜子挑着额前的白发，\"嗯哼?\"多少有点不置可否，\"那就让我看看绘梨衣要怎么报复吧？嗯...白得好彻底...\"瞪着镜子里自己额头前的碎发"}
{"time": 1753981840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898036047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（主食配主食，想想就好噎）"}
{"time": 1753981855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710911546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "就点些团子吃，然后来碗豆浆"}
{"time": 1753981867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095870772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么你了)"}
{"time": 1753981878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461540727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎日本人）"}
{"time": 1753981881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519362115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(米饭配方便面啊)"}
