{"time": 1753981937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520979875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=34A411CD56DA3F6DF2495519119A3349.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTAmXuOp7Ld8ctB2gzP9V3geIbhzBiqgAEg_woo2PWm8svnjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQJNUTMeMU8pRA6luRtcxVMXoCwos&amp;rkey=CAMSMPP7idps0jnI7OwBy2DP8wjfUZcD8w7RDTQo2qLnMNPAI2vlQVCXrbsN1Qf5cgvJEw,file_size=16426]"}
{"time": 1753982180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391697207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=380542827]“那还不简单”她左手放下梳子，按住你的肩膀。一柄水粉配色、光可鉴人的短刀出现在她右手中，轻快地舞着刀花"}
{"time": 1753982424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687240657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1391697207]\"这是要干嘛?\"扭过头看着她手里的小刀，抽抽嘴角"}
{"time": 1753982465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568374659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“给你背上改个花刀什么的”"}
{"time": 1753982690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387460435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且我这可是打了招呼的，不算偷袭哦”她围着你绕了半圈，观察着你的表情"}
{"time": 1753982726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058367171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"快点梳头发啦。\"懒得理她的耍宝，甚至嘴角有些微微上扬，同时对着镜子小心翼翼地藏起额前的白发"}
{"time": 1753982938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782964704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“切，感恩戴德吧。我可不是乘人之危的人”她收起刀，用她赖以成名的微量滑液帮你顺毛"}
{"time": 1753983052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357781834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"效果感觉倒是...意外地好，绘梨衣这不是很擅长打理头发吗\""}
{"time": 1753983073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321124356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "弄好前额的头发，看着镜子里的动作"}
{"time": 1753983276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681969631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这很难说）"}
{"time": 1753983364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495143972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有护发素说啥呢)"}
{"time": 1753983420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233558375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是）"}
{"time": 1753983426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092475198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这能算会打理吗）"}
{"time": 1753983536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357045624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉赢了这个世界下70的人了)"}
{"time": 1753983740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104865355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行了行了”她很快给你梳完头，头发前所未有地舒贴，没有分叉、没有打结，随手一扬都能反光"}
{"time": 1753983779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053870715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要不是看在还要搭顺风的份上，我才懒得给你梳着梳那的”"}
{"time": 1753983910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689608183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼哼，以后还要经常依靠我们吧？这算收点利息啦。\"站起身，从怀里拿出零玉放在桌上，\"不考虑之后一起去火山?一个人待在炎火村很容易生锈吧？\""}
{"time": 1753984348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406767634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总觉得跟你们走早晚有害身心健康……而且可以自己去当那什么，猎人”她坐回床上“不过不能在炎火村这种地方，更不利于身心健康了”"}
{"time": 1753984662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986814160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，这种地方是这样啦。\"激发一些寒气，\"在火山也能维持正常温度的诀窍哦?\"点点零玉，语气突然正经起来，\"嗯...事已至此，我也不会用跟着我们这种话来束缚绘梨衣的。\""}
{"time": 1753984762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771854556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停顿了一下，撩起耳畔的发丝，\"绘梨衣想离开的话，随时都可以，做猎人啦，回山里啦，不想看见我们啦...向往更自由的生活啦，都可以。\"轻轻点一下脑袋"}
